        "note": "Mathlib has Chebyshev type bounds only with the constants log 2 and log 4: psi_ge and pi_ge, psi of n at least n log 2 - log of n + 1; theta_le_log4_mul_x, theta of x at most x log 4; psi_le, psi of x at most x log 4 + 2 sqrt x log x; and psi_le_const_mul_self. A search of Mathlib for chebyshev, psi and theta bounds found no bound with Chebyshev's 1852 constant A. This entry uses Mathlib's psi and its bounds for log of the factorial.",
